    "innovation": "This paper presents a detailed intercomparison of stratospheric polar processing diagnostics from four major reanalyses, revealing a significant improvement in their agreement for temperature-based metrics after 1999, which is attributed to the transition in assimilated satellite data from TOVS (Tiros Operational Vertical Sounder) to ATOVS.",
