            "paragraph": "Since the work described in Lawrence et al. (2015), the MERRA-2 reanalysis (intended as a replacement for MERRA) has become available and widely used, including for polar processing and polar vortex studies (e.g., Manney and Lawrence, 2016; Lambert and Santee, 2018; Lawrence and Manney, 2018).",
